00:42:15,662 --> 00:42:19,652
You know, being able to manipulate and grasp things is sort of a very early step in that direction.

352
00:42:21,390 --> 00:42:24,132
So deep neural nets are making significant strides.

353
00:42:24,782 --> 00:42:25,520
It's pretty exciting.

354
00:42:25,806 --> 00:42:29,316
You almost should certainly be considering how they might be able to solve problems in your domain.

