372
00:43:38,560 --> 00:43:49,680
there's a lot of things I don't know, and I think one of the things that is really good is to work on things where you have some of the skills that are necessary to accomplish something, but you don't have all of them.

373
00:43:49,760 --> 00:43:58,532
And so by collaborating with people who have different skills than you, you often pick up some of their expertise.

374
00:43:58,734 --> 00:44:02,852
